@startuml
title Figure 21(a). Atomic Booking and Concurrency Handling
top to bottom direction

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam TitleFontSize 18
skinparam shadowing false

component "Verify JWT and derive user" as Authenticate
component "Check active membership, tenant,\nresource access, slot, and points" as Validate
component "Run serializable\nPrisma transaction" as Transaction
component "Create booking" as Booking
component "Append point deduction\nwhen pointCost > 0" as Deduction
database "PostgreSQL" as Database

Authenticate -down-> Validate
Validate -down-> Transaction
Transaction -down-> Booking
Transaction -down-> Deduction
Booking -down-> Database
Deduction -down-> Database

note right of Transaction
The service retries serialization conflicts.
Booking and deduction commit or roll back together.
end note
@enduml
